Package: reprokit
Title: Reproduce and Check Results When Raw Data Cannot Be Shared
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("D.M.", "Kloppenburg", , "192165061+dm-k1@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helps authors who cannot share raw data report the sufficient
    statistics that let readers reproduce their results exactly, or decide
    that synthetic data or the raw data are needed. Helps readers check
    whether reported test statistics are consistent with each other. Authors
    must state why the data are not shared, and the output lists what readers
    lose, because sharing raw data remains the standard.
